  "title": "Nourishing Uruguayan Steak Empanadas",
  "description": "A traditional Uruguayan dish featuring lean minced steak and confit tomato in a pillowy pastry, perfect for a high protein meal. This recipe is a nostalgic and flavorful option for any time of day.",
