  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the minced steak and cook until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Stir in the confit tomato, mustard, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Roll out the empanada pastry and cut out circles of dough.",
    "Spoon the steak mixture onto one half of each dough circle.",
    "Fold the dough in half and press the edges to seal.",
    "Brush the tops with a little bit of water and bake for 20 minutes."
  ],
